<title>POLAND: JELFA JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.17 vs   2.53</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.03 vs   3.48</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.02 vs   2.42</p>
<p> Sales		   20.54 vs  10.51</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    14.91 vs  11.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	21.67 vs  15.85</p>
<p> Operating profit    21.44 vs  14.50</p>
<p> Sales		   93.70 vs  73.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Przedsiebiorstwo</p>
<p>Farmaceutyczne Jelfa SA w Jeleniej Gorze.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
